{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2021-03-17 07:30:00', 'title': 'ANSYS CONGRATULATES ZOLTAN CENDES ON ELECTION TO THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING', 'text': "PITTSBURG, MARCH 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ZOLTAN CENDES, FORMER ANSYS CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER AND FOUNDER OF ANSOFT, WAS ELECTED TO THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING (NAE) THE NAE CITED CENDES' CONTRIBUTIONS TO THEORY, DEVELOPMENT AND COMMERCIALIZATION OF ELECTROMAGNETICS SIMULATION SOFTWARE, ALL OF WHICH ALSO LED TO THE CREATION OF ANSYS HFSS FORMER ANSYS (NASDAQ: ANSS) CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER AND THE FOUNDER OF ANSOFT CORPORATION, ZOLTAN CENDES, WAS ELECTED TO THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING (NAE) FOR HIS PIONEERING WORK IN THE THEORY, DEVELOPMENT AND COMMERCIALIZATION OF ELECTROMAGNETICS SIMULATION SOFTWARE. HIS EFFORTS IN THIS SPACE LED TO THE DEVELOPMENT OF ANSYS HFSS,\xa0THE INDUSTRY-LEADING SOFTWARE FOR DESIGNING AND SIMULATING HIGH-FREQUENCY ELECTRONIC PRODUCTS."}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2021-03-17 07:00:00', 'title': 'KELSEY DEBRIYN JOINS ANSYS AS HEAD OF INVESTOR RELATIONS AND GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH, MARCH 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) ANNOUNCED THAT KELSEY DEBRIYN HAS JOINED THE COMPANY TO LEAD INVESTOR RELATIONS AND GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS, EFFECTIVE TODAY. IN THIS ROLE, SHE WILL DEEPEN THE INVESTMENT COMMUNITY'S UNDERSTANDING OF ANSYS' STRATEGY, COMPETITIVE DIFFERENTIATION AND FINANCIAL OUTLOOK AS WELL AS MANAGE STAKEHOLDER ENGAGEMENT WITH INVESTORS AND POLICYMAKERS."}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2021-03-17 07:30:00', 'title': 'ANSYS CONGRATULATES ZOLTAN CENDES ON ELECTION TO THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING', 'text': "PITTSBURG, MARCH 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ZOLTAN CENDES, FORMER ANSYS CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER AND FOUNDER OF ANSOFT, WAS ELECTED TO THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING (NAE) THE NAE CITED CENDES' CONTRIBUTIONS TO THEORY, DEVELOPMENT AND COMMERCIALIZATION OF ELECTROMAGNETICS SIMULATION SOFTWARE, ALL OF WH